Package: levygof
Title: Goodness-of-Fit Tests for Levy Degradation Processes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Amedée Rytrace", "Tito", , "rytracetito5@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Christian", "Paroissin", , "christian.paroissin@univ-pau.fr", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Goodness-of-fit tests for parametric Levy degradation processes
    (gamma, Wiener, inverse Gaussian, variance-gamma and Meixner
    processes) from one or several trajectories. With regular inspections
    the observed increments are tested; with irregular inspections the
    parameters are estimated by maximum likelihood (package 'levyfit'), the
    trajectories are resampled on a regular grid by stochastic bridges
    (package 'levyBridge', Grall-Maes (2012) <doi:10.1177/1748006X12462522>)
    and the reconstructed increments are tested with tests for independent
    and identically distributed samples.
